  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 7 - 8 × 0 + 9 = 2\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1) 2 and 0\n\n7 - 8 × 0 + 9 = 2 ⇒ 7 - 8 × 2 + 9 = 0\n\n⇒ 7 - __**8 × 2**__ + 9 = 0\n\n⇒ __**7 + 9**__ - 16 = 0\n\n⇒ __16 - 16__ = 0\n\n**⇒ 0 = 0 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) 8 and 9\n\n7 - 8 × 0 + 9 = 2 ⇒ 7 - 9 × 0 + 8 = 2\n\n⇒ 7 - __**9 × 0**__ + 8 = 2\n\n⇒ __7 + 8__ - 0 = 2\n\n⇒ **__15 - 0__** = 2\n\n⇒ 15 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 8 and 7\n\n7 - 8 × 0 + 9 = 2​ ⇒ 8 - 7 × 0 + 9 = 2\n\n⇒ 8 - __**7 × 0**__ + 9 = 2\n\n⇒ __8 + 9__ - 0 = 2\n\n⇒ __17 - 0__ = 2\n\n⇒ 17 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 7 and 2\n\n7 - 8 × 0 + 9 = 2​ ⇒ 2 - 8 × 0 + 9 = 7\n\n⇒ 2 - __**8 × 0**__ + 9 = 7\n\n⇒ __2 + 9__ - 0 = 7\n\n⇒ __11 - 0__ = 7\n\n⇒ 11 ≠ 7 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.\n\n89",
